case 2': $(\phi^1_1-\phi^1_0)=\pm\frac{\pi}{2},~(\phi^2_1-\phi^2_0)-(\phi^1_1-\phi^1_0)=\pm\frac{\pi}{2}$ and $|y^2_1|=1$, and MACs are written as:
$$\{\cos^4\theta+\sin^4\theta,|y^1_1|^2\cos^4\theta+\sin^4\theta\}$$
